      "text": {
        "jp": "正門は兵士が見張っているはずだ。\r\nいま出ていくのは自殺行為だぜ。",
        "official_en": "The main gate’ll be swarming with guards. Going in that way’d be suicide.",
        "real_en": "The main gate should be guarded by soldiers. Trying to leave now would be suicide."
